# MOSS-TTS v1.5 production-inference closure for CPython 3.12.12 on
# macOS ARM64, built from official revision
# 58b20a0d5fcc6766658d50967a90a9d890009a46.
#
# Whoopy's persistent worker performs local file-based PyTorch inference for
# the Local Transformer 5B and delay 8B models. The upstream Gradio, training,
# CUDA-only flash-attention, llama.cpp, TensorRT, and ONNX extras are excluded.
# The worker also bypasses upstream URL/audio decoding and analysis, so Gradio,
# Accelerate, TorchCodec, FFmpeg bindings, librosa, SciPy, Numba, tiktoken,
# orjson, ninja, and einops are intentionally outside this inference closure.
# Model checkpoints and MOSS Audio Tokenizer weights remain separate verified
# managed model packs and are never included in this Python runtime archive.

